{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "9132129896885275", "organization": {"id": "214634720683704", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "24926809450330291"}]}, "id": "1595685981846712"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "9132129896885275"}]}, "id": "2203663716718746"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "4528444947250227"}]}, "id": "1272123763199438"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "4116075871835917"}]}, "id": "658243781816830"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "9132129896885275", "release_date": 1765908000, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 5}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25534582619546743"}, "id": "2582846135247804"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1773834555, "id": "25845921198412882", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v5", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 4, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "25845927988412203"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "9132129896885275"}, "id": "25845927988412203", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "9132129896885275", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "715330238219462"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2828633417481543", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Oldest Golden Treasure", "keywords": ["escaperoom", "myst\u00e8re", "\u00e9nigme", "d\u00e9tective", "histoire"], "long_description": "# Une Affaire Perdue dans le Temps\nEnfile le costume de d\u00e9tective et enqu\u00eate sur la myst\u00e9rieuse disparition de ton coll\u00e8gue dans cette aventure narrative riche en \u00e9nigmes. Chaque d\u00e9cision te rapproche de la v\u00e9rit\u00e9\u2026 ou t'en \u00e9loigne un peu plus. As-tu ce qu'il faut pour r\u00e9soudre l'affaire ?\n\n\nTu devras r\u00e9soudre des \u00e9nigmes retorses,\n{1569394907502944}\nt'infiltrer dans des planques secr\u00e8tes,\n{781778017955707}\net voyager \u00e0 travers le temps\n{26573933205577883}\npour d\u00e9couvrir la v\u00e9rit\u00e9 et mener ta mission \u00e0 bien.\n\n\n# D\u00e9couvre la v\u00e9ritable histoire derri\u00e8re d'anciens tr\u00e9sors en or \nThe game is inspired by the oldest known gold treasure in the world, found in the Varna Necropolis, and features historical facts that you uncover during your playthrough as part of the story.\n\n\n# Apr\u00e8s avoir termin\u00e9 l'aventure principale, tu d\u00e9bloques le Mode \"SpeedRun\"\nUn d\u00e9fi d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux joueurs comp\u00e9titifs. Rejoue le jeu, optimise chacun de tes d\u00e9placements et tes solutions d'\u00e9nigmes, et peaufine ta strat\u00e9gie jusqu'\u00e0 la perfection. Gr\u00e2ce aux temps au tour et aux classements mondiaux, tu peux affronter tes amis et des joueurs du monde entier dans plusieurs cat\u00e9gories. ", "short_description": "Enfile le costume de d\u00e9tective, r\u00e9sous des \u00e9nigmes et d\u00e9couvre la v\u00e9rit\u00e9 derri\u00e8re la disparition de ton coll\u00e8gue. Voyage \u00e0 travers le temps, explore des mondes immersifs et perce le myst\u00e8re dans cette aventure VR escape room !"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1850140562365174", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Oldest Golden Treasure", "keywords": ["escaperoom", "puzle", "misterio", "detective", "aventura"], "long_description": "# Un caso olvidado en el tiempo\nPonte en la piel de un detective e investiga la misteriosa desaparici\u00f3n de tu compa\u00f1ero en esta emocionante aventura narrativa repleta de puzles. Cada decisi\u00f3n que tomes te acercar\u00e1 a la verdad\u2026 o te alejar\u00e1 de ella. \u00bfTienes lo que hay que tener para resolver el caso?\n\n\nTendr\u00e1s que resolver ingeniosos acertijos,\n{26043058682053590}\ncolarte en escondites secretos\n{2824339461247680}\ny viajar en el tiempo\n{907198088737237}\npara descubrir la verdad y completar tu misi\u00f3n.\n\n\n# Aprende sobre tesoros de oro aut\u00e9nticos de la antig\u00fcedad\nEste juego est\u00e1 inspirado en el tesoro de oro m\u00e1s antiguo que se conoce en el mundo, hallado en la necr\u00f3polis de Varna, e incluye datos hist\u00f3ricos reales que ir\u00e1s descubriendo a lo largo de la aventura.\n\n\n# Desbloquear\u00e1s el modo \"SpeedRun\" al pasarte el juego \nUn desaf\u00edo espec\u00edfico para jugadores competitivos. Juega una vez m\u00e1s optimizando tus movimientos y estrategias hasta alcanzar la perfecci\u00f3n. Hay tablas de clasificaci\u00f3n mundiales para que puedas competir contra amigos y jugadores de todo el mundo en m\u00faltiples categor\u00edas.", "short_description": "Ponte en el pellejo de un detective, resuelve puzles y descubre la verdad tras la desaparici\u00f3n de tu compa\u00f1ero. \u00a1Viaja en el tiempo, explora los detalles de mundos perdidos y resuelve el misterio en este envolvente escape room en VR!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "GeneralTextLocationLogoMeta.png", "id": "32617147411232424", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823286_32617147427899089_4922388931432701398_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y9Q0_CPBsbkQ7kNvwFGF_qv&_nc_oc=AdqgkVCQiPK8