": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_784020281399260_94659241665239986_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nHMoT6GnwrEQ7kNvwEnnKeG&_nc_oc=AdqRbxnVgg56jxCICHYkkYsvsWty41qr9uzeyLFfROMkMHF6bERyl6GovSlV2du2Ghc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDV5v9CyWwaCJ6dQlhGNmBV_F3lg39sdXvg_E3Ijf1mvQ&oe=6A6B51C1"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "1396512661412029", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304019_1396512664745362_6788073616368509319_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3LpmwTTv2RgQ7kNvwHv9AFD&_nc_oc=AdrDanxZZWE8pwvNuA3KvadDS9-uM4diwZyPzUteROYtVvqs7NxSaqMqi4GrGiOo89Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCCG7NpNDnVujkfk3aDB9bXeJ9DySjE5ymn2_2UBRPkwA&oe=6A6B5F2A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440Exact.png", "id": "1518346059500614", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820387_1518346066167280_4068898321792701709_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IdwgCKaAMZgQ7kNvwGEnVB6&_nc_oc=AdrRl2xXFVThh8OkA3YB4aQjYOaHQ6MI0PVuIkYbWTKllolPyhMKJd5ReR8nSxfLdaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB7YEJZBN5tfM-4fkB8jkF5AIVluouiINj-MI3FV9VOjg&oe=6A6B52D4"}, "display_name": "Oldest Golden Treasure", "keywords": ["puzzle", "escaperoom", "adventure", "timetravel", "mystery"], "long_description": "# A Case Lost in Time \nStep into the role of a detective and investigate the mysterious disappearance of your colleague in this story-driven puzzle adventure. Every decision you make brings you closer to the truth... or further from it. Do you have what it takes to crack the case? \n\nYou will need to solve tricky puzzles,\n{1479542716578500}\nbreak into secret hideouts,\n{1497510901398326}\nand travel through time\n{2581386012205578}\nto find out the truth and to finish the mission.\n\n\n# Discover the real history behind ancient gold treasures\nThe game is inspired by the oldest known gold treasure in the world, found in the Varna Necropolis, and features historical facts that you uncover during your playthrough as part of the story.\n\n\n# After completing the main adventure you unlock \"SpeedRun Mode\" \nA dedicated challenge for competitive players. Replay the game, optimize every movement and puzzle solution, and refine your strategy to perfection. With lap times and global leaderboards you can compete with your friends and players around the world in multiple categories.\n", "short_description": "Step into the role of a detective, solve puzzles, and uncover the truth behind your colleague\u2019s disappearance. Travel through time, explore immersive worlds, and crack the mystery in this VR escape room adventure!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "882544554787710", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Oldest Golden Treasure", "keywords": ["r\u00e4tsel", "detektiv", "goldschatz", "escaperoom", "abenteuer"], "long_description": "# Ein Fall verloren in der Zeit \n\u00dcbernimm die Rolle eines Detektivs und untersuche das mysteri\u00f6se Verschwinden deines Kollegen in diesem VR-Escape-Room-Abenteuer. Jede Entscheidung bringt dich n\u00e4her an die Wahrheit... oder entfernt dich weiter davon. Bist du bereit, den Fall zu l\u00f6sen?\n\nDu musst komplexe R\u00e4tsel l\u00f6sen,\n{1095200222798569}\nin geheime Verstecke einbrechen, \n{27195792183343313}\nund durch die Zeit reisen, \n{976693595021145}\num die Wahrheit herauszufinden und die Mission abzuschlie\u00dfen. \n\n\n# Entdecke die wahre Geschichte hinter uralten Goldsch\u00e4tzen \nDas Spiel ist inspiriert vom \u00e4ltesten bekannten Goldschatz der Welt, der in der Nekropole von Varna gefunden wurde, und enth\u00e4lt historische Fakten, die du im Laufe der Geschichte aufdeckst. \n\n\n# Nach Abschluss des Hauptabenteuers schaltest du den \"SpeedRun\"-Modus frei \nEine besondere Herausforderung f\u00fcr kompetitive Spieler. Spiele das Spiel erneut, optimiere jede Bewegung und R\u00e4tsell\u00f6sung und verfeinere deine Strategie bis zur Perfektion. Mit Rundenzeiten und globalen Bestenlisten kannst du dich mit deinen Freunden und Spielern auf der ganzen Welt in mehreren Kategorien messen.", "short_description": "\u00dcbernimm die Rolle eines Detektivs, l\u00f6se R\u00e4tsel und decke die Wahrheit hinter dem Verschwinden deines Kollegen auf. Reise durch die Zeit, erkunde immersive Welten und knacke das Mysterium in diesem VR-Escape-Room-Abenteuer!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vasil4n.com/ogt/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vasil4N", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vasil4n.com/ogt", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de", "es", "fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25845927988412203"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820270_1815467975845443_4183612993417657774_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tCFBRSiNMTMQ7kNvwGVvVmD&_nc_oc=Adpys3zxXzJLLZ9mUB3UoWF3tuPXo4oB6BOG6J5HQC5ict-VAFLdAKJxHc_Q_Ov6O18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCUEJ7r7t9p4oH2tJV1cIv6_DX3Pf